{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1277369-official-publications","id":1277369,"title":"Official Publications","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-29T09:11:19-08:00","id":1277369,"title":"Official Publications","content":"Second Edition brought me back to the game I met in the late 90s, it's just that great.<br /> I devoured the book and loved the simple mechanics and this new flavor as well.<br /> <br /> One thing that I don't understand, though, is what can I take as &quot;official&quot;?<br /> Post forums from writers are official? What about the blog? Will the Time Gift be published in an official book or will people who don't care about the forum/blog posts be &quot;left out&quot;?<br /> There are many topics here and I'm not in the mood to dig deep to find official stuff that otherwise might get overlooked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24954-blodm\u00e5ne","name":"blodm\u00e5ne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24954_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T10:00:30-08:00","id":1277371,"title":"","content":"My understanding is - and I may be wrong on one or more counts - that the only 'official' material is what's published in a proper, titled Werewolf: the Forsaken book.<br /> <br /> Material posted in Onyx Path blogs has some weight to it but is not 'official' official, as it were - I don't think Forsaken material in blogs undergoes the same checking process by the licensors that content in the books does.<br /> <br /> Forum posts from writers are absolutely not official. Stuff we throw around on here might, one day, end up in a book - for example, I first used the Ukusgualu for my Paris-set Forsaken game, posted some stuff about them on here, and in Shunned I've had the opportunity to give them a proper write-up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-29T10:17:04-08:00","id":1277374,"title":"","content":"Good to know.<br /> Hopefully Time Gift gets tested and published, I goddamn loved it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24954-blodm\u00e5ne","name":"blodm\u00e5ne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24954_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T00:27:46-08:00","id":1277619,"title":"","content":"As a fan - and it's no way official stance - I treat developers 'fan' materials like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1757_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1757\" data-vbnamecard=\"1757\">Acrozatarim</a> as 'semi-official'. I.e. They are (mostly) related to canon and brilliantly written, probably working as good examples what you <i>can</i> do with <b>WtF</b> - only the stuff you <i>not really</i> need to use. It's just high quality fan materials, coherent with gameline at large. It's not like Chris writes on forum Gifts for Pure that are not in official books... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>WtF</b> - and <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> at large - are sandbox game. You use what materials you like. Even official supplements <i>should </i>be optional ( it's not always true, as <b>WtF</b> 2E corebook lacks some materials that were not enough to be put in it in first place - like full Hosts rules or mentioned Gifts for Pure werewolves ). Stuff like Chris fan materials are just probably most compatible with game as envisioned by developers - as it's stuff written<i><b> by</b></i> developer of the game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-31T10:44:06-08:00","id":1277678,"title":"","content":"Here <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1016390-secrets-of-the-covenants-hidden-devotions\">hoping stuff like this</a> doesn't happen with Werewolf; over the top official mechanics &quot;published&quot; on PasteBin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24954-blodm\u00e5ne","name":"blodm\u00e5ne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24954_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}